\par}
{\tc\tcl2 \v Intel(R) Multi-Buffer Crypto for IPsec Library}
The library provides software crypto acceleration primarily targeting packet processing applications. It can be used for application such as: IPsec, TLS, Wireless (RAN), Cable or MPEG DRM.\par
The library is hosted on {\f2 GitHub} and is used as software crypto provider in {\f2 DPDK}, {\f2 Intel(R) QAT Engine} and {\f2 FD.io}.\par
Using crypto interfaces from the above frameworks gives freedom to change providers without subsequent application modifications. The library can also be used directly through its native API.\par
