{\tc\tcl3 \v 9. Backwards compatibility}
In version 1.4, backward compile time symbol compatibility with library version 0.53 has been removed.\par
Applications are encouraged to use new symbol names introduced in version 0.54.\par
If required, compatibility symbol mapping can be implemented in the application. See compatibility symbol mapping in v1.3 header file: {\f2 https://github.com/intel/intel-ipsec-mb/blob/v1.3/lib/intel-ipsec-mb.h#L246}\par}
