{\tc\tcl3 \v 12. FIPS Compliance}
The library does not fulfill technical requirements to achieve Cryptographic Module (CMVP) certification as a standalone component. It is fit for Cryptographic Algorithm validation and certification (CAVP) and it can be part of CMVP as one of the components.\par
