\pard\plain \s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid {\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
Optional parameters for {\b imb_ml_dsa_keypair()}. A NULL {\i params}  pointer selects the common-case default: fresh-random key generation. Note that passing a bare {\f2 = \{ 0 \}}  structure instead is not equivalent, as its {\i size}  field would be rejected - see {\i size}  below.\par
Always initialize instances of this structure with {\b IMB_ML_DSA_KEYGEN_PARAMS_INIT()} (or otherwise ensure {\i size}  is set to sizeof(IMB_ML_DSA_KEYGEN_PARAMS)) - see {\i size}  below. \par
}}
