Sets up suite_id and session_id fields for selected cipher suite in provided {\i job}  structure. }}\par
{\s17\sa60\sb30\widctlpar\qj \fs22\cgrid 
This is mandatory operation for BURST API as suite_id is used to speed up job dispatch process. This operation is optional but helpful for JOB API use case.\par
